# Unity — the Android export payload (1.8 GB, arm64-v8a only).
# Deliberately NOT versioned: a single file (symbols/arm64-v8a/libil2cpp.so, 243 MB) exceeds
# GitHub's 100 MB hard limit, and this export is expected to be replaced once the Unity source
# project is recovered and the real assessment games are built.
#
# ⚠️ This export is NOT reproducible from this repo — the Unity source project is not here.
# Re-apply instructions for all 7 integration layers: UNITY_INTEGRATION_SNAPSHOT.md
# The payload itself must be backed up outside version control.
unity/

# Documentation — excluded from the code repo by project decision.
# Only README.md is versioned. Everything else (spec, design system, engineering
# docs, Unity re-apply notes) stays on disk but out of git and off the remote.
#
# ⚠️ These files are NOT backed up by version control. Keep an external copy —
# UNITY_INTEGRATION_SNAPSHOT.md in particular is the only record of how to
# re-apply the Unity integration, and unity/ is also excluded (see above).
*.md
!README.md
docs/
markdown_files/
